  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you pay a single rupee</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether an IIM fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it
    against the real world before you spend two years and your family's savings finding out the hard
