  </p>

  <h2 id="not-worth-it">Honest cases where even an IIM is not worth it</h2>

  <p>
    This is the section most "should I do an IIM" articles skip, because it is not a good sales pitch
    for a coaching institute. It is, however, the section that saves people two years and a
    six-figure or seven-figure decision they did not need to make.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Signal</th>
          <th>What is actually true</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
